{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Face profile of a head with Mark's shapes (Audio2Face v3.0, carried by shapes/head_shapes.py): the MPFB template's (test-head.face.json) weights re-scaled by shapes/mark_profile.py so that every expression, cue, leak and brow move reaches as far as on MPFB's shapes. Do not edit by hand: change the template and run mark_profile.py.",
